  "comments": [
    {
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "comment": "The vitamin K1, haemin solution and the cysteine are added after the medium has been boiled and cooled under CO2. Adjust pH to 7.2 using 8 N NaOH."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "comment": "Distribute under N2 and autoclave."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 4,
